WEBVTT

01:24.100 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:30.910 --> 01:35.310
<i>Dear Mother in suspended animation 
on our distant home planet...</i>

01:35.730 --> 01:37.110
<i>How are you?</i>

01:37.110 --> 01:39.730
<i>I've finally been dispatched to Earth,</i>

01:39.730 --> 01:42.330
<i>and I'm proudly working for the League!</i>

01:42.880 --> 01:46.700
<i>What's more, I received the honor
of being assigned to </i>his<i> unit!</i>

01:51.500 --> 01:55.860
<i>I would love to see you and report 
all this to you in person,</i>

01:55.860 --> 01:59.580
<i>but there's no easy way to travel 
between our world and Earth.</i>

01:59.580 --> 02:00.720
<i>It's unfortunate.</i>

02:01.130 --> 02:05.800
<i>We are not permitted to utter 
the name of he whom we serve</i>

02:05.800 --> 02:08.100
<i>out of reverence for his top-class strength.</i>

02:11.910 --> 02:18.200
<i>Which is why we, his subordinates, 
respectfully address him as the General!</i>

02:29.950 --> 02:32.130
Hey, hey! It's lunchtime!

02:32.130 --> 02:33.610
Wanna come with me to the cafeteria?

02:33.610 --> 02:36.070
Shut up. I'm busy. Get lost.

02:36.070 --> 02:37.530
Okay! Too bad!

02:39.250 --> 02:42.710
I should have taken a paid vacation day...

02:42.720 --> 02:45.680
<b><i>Public unveiling today!!!</i></b>

02:42.720 --> 02:45.680
<b>Uenono Zoo's baby panda</b>

02:46.340 --> 02:50.850
I accepted that only the winners 
would get to see this in person today,

02:50.850 --> 02:53.530
but why do a lottery in the first place?

02:53.800 --> 02:56.830
Let the people who want to see it see it.

02:56.830 --> 02:57.810
Right?

03:02.070 --> 03:04.780
<b><i>Public unveiling today!!!</i></b>

03:02.070 --> 03:04.780
<b>Uenono Zoo's baby panda</b>

03:19.640 --> 03:23.810
The health and safety of 
the baby panda come first.

03:24.860 --> 03:28.130
<i>When you're that cute,
there's just no way around it.</i>

03:31.610 --> 03:34.310
<i>Oh man, this never ends!</i>

03:34.310 --> 03:36.220
<i>Everyone else has already gone home!</i>

03:36.220 --> 03:37.900
<i>But I at least need to—</i>

03:37.900 --> 03:38.800
Hey.

03:40.830 --> 03:45.270
You're that rookie who joined up recently.

03:45.610 --> 03:49.790
<i>It's the G-G-G-G-General!</i>

03:50.790 --> 03:53.290
Your shift is long over.

03:53.290 --> 03:55.050
Get the hell outta here.

03:55.050 --> 03:56.610
B-But...

03:56.610 --> 04:02.000
I-I-I just thought... I would 
get through... this much, sir!

04:03.720 --> 04:06.750
I apologize for being so slow.

04:12.890 --> 04:17.870
This ain't anything 
that needs finishing tonight.

04:19.020 --> 04:20.360
Neither's this.

04:20.360 --> 04:21.520
Or this.

04:21.890 --> 04:24.250
Don't try to bulldoze through it all.

04:24.250 --> 04:29.530
It's gonna take more than a day
 for Earth to fall to our planet.

04:30.540 --> 04:32.860
This is a protracted war.

04:32.860 --> 04:37.590
If you don't look after your own mind 
and body, you'll burn out someday.

04:38.080 --> 04:41.670
Tomorrow's a day off. Make the most of it.

04:50.250 --> 04:53.590
<i>H-H-H-He spoke to me!</i>

04:54.180 --> 04:58.160
<i>He told me to make the most of it, but how?</i>

04:58.720 --> 05:01.570
<i>"How to spend a day off"...</i>

05:05.160 --> 05:08.060
What? You went to the zoo?

05:08.060 --> 05:09.520
Y-Yes, sir!

05:09.530 --> 05:14.500
<b>Uenono Zoo</b>

05:09.870 --> 05:12.460
The line to view the pandas starts here!

05:12.460 --> 05:14.490
Please come forward another step!

05:17.550 --> 05:19.400
<i>It's so cute!</i>

05:19.960 --> 05:24.300
General, you wrote in a report
that it would be worth revisiting!

05:24.300 --> 05:27.210
So I was wondering what it was like...

05:28.130 --> 05:31.770
I-I'd be honored if you would accept these.

05:31.770 --> 05:33.530
I hear they're popular!

05:40.390 --> 05:41.850
Not bad.

05:43.660 --> 05:46.110
I-I'll be on my way now!

05:51.280 --> 05:52.680
Hey, he melted.

05:52.680 --> 05:54.430
You okay?

05:54.430 --> 05:56.340
<i>Dear beloved Mother...</i>

05:56.750 --> 06:02.490
<i>I will keep working hard under the General!</i>

06:10.050 --> 06:12.160
A gift from the zoo...

06:24.210 --> 06:28.260
I'm... supposed to chew this up?

06:29.710 --> 06:32.650
Damn you, Earthlings! What barbarism!

06:32.980 --> 06:35.670
It's too cute!

06:35.660 --> 06:38.960
He decorated his place with them
until the expiration date

06:38.960 --> 06:44.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

06:38.960 --> 06:44.960
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

07:16.210 --> 07:17.070
I...

07:19.750 --> 07:21.950
I want a pet panda.

07:23.950 --> 07:29.040
<i>At times like this when I drag myself home,
exhausted from work...</i>

07:29.540 --> 07:32.220
<i>If only I had a pet panda...</i>

08:02.250 --> 08:04.210
That would rule.

08:05.550 --> 08:09.730
No, wait. "Pet" is rather presumptuous.

08:10.430 --> 08:14.070
Once humanity is no more, 
the pandas will propagate

08:14.070 --> 08:17.380
and they will coexist with us.

08:15.010 --> 08:17.390
Paradise full of <b>pandas</b>

08:17.700 --> 08:21.420
So rather than pets, 
won't they be our friends...?

08:21.270 --> 08:23.850
<b>*His ability to think is negatively
 impacted by his exhaustion</b>

08:24.140 --> 08:27.040
With a panda...

08:27.360 --> 08:29.570
<b>Gaming together</b>

08:27.650 --> 08:29.180
We'd game together.

08:29.570 --> 08:31.780
<b>Seeing the cherry 
blossoms together</b>

08:29.580 --> 08:31.310
We'd go see cherry blossoms together.

08:31.780 --> 08:38.830
<b>Sharing our troubles</b>

08:32.030 --> 08:33.780
We'd share our troubles.

08:33.780 --> 08:35.750
You must have it rough, too.

08:36.160 --> 08:38.820
What? Not so much?

08:38.830 --> 08:41.040
<b>Drinking parties</b>

08:39.250 --> 08:40.690
Drinking parties.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.360
Trips.

08:41.040 --> 08:43.250
<b>Traveling together</b>

08:43.600 --> 08:48.650
How splendid the world will be
 with humanity gone...

09:03.970 --> 09:05.170
Pandas...

09:08.970 --> 09:14.370
<i>On this weekday morning, I renewed 
my resolve to wipe out the human race.</i>

09:15.550 --> 09:19.040
<i>I wanna take a paid vacation day
and spend it at the zoo...</i>

09:20.360 --> 09:23.120
<i>And so I am.</i>

09:23.120 --> 09:27.360
<i>However, I've encountered a serious dilemma.</i>

09:33.360 --> 09:36.940
<i>What color are panda tails?</i>

09:37.540 --> 09:41.770
<i>It's generally accepted that they're white.</i>

09:41.770 --> 09:43.980
<i>But is that true?</i>

09:43.980 --> 09:45.270
<i>Are they </i>really<i> white?</i>

09:45.830 --> 09:50.280
<i>Their ears and limbs are black, 
yet their tails are white?</i>

09:50.280 --> 09:53.690
<i>I won't believe it until I see it for myself.</i>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.150
*He bought an annual pass

09:54.140 --> 09:58.150
<i>Now show me your tail, panda!</i>

10:10.830 --> 10:15.760
Fifteen minutes later

10:15.840 --> 10:20.890
Thirty minutes later

10:20.970 --> 10:25.220
One hour later

10:25.220 --> 10:28.850
Two hours later

10:37.950 --> 10:44.240
<i>For two hours, it's just been
sitting there stuffing its face.</i>

10:44.480 --> 10:49.200
<i>But if I stay too much longer, 
I'll be in the way of other visitors.</i>

10:49.470 --> 10:53.680
<i>And it could be my imagination, 
but I feel like the staff is eyeing me.</i>

10:55.620 --> 11:00.840
<i>Worse, I've taken so many pics, 
my battery's at critical.</i>

11:09.730 --> 11:11.560
<i>That was the best shot.</i>

11:14.280 --> 11:15.610
So be it.

11:18.380 --> 11:19.730
Look, it's moving!

11:22.740 --> 11:25.150
<i>Oh, right, my phone's dead!</i>

11:28.550 --> 11:31.200
Mr. Panda sat back down...

11:31.200 --> 11:32.350
Sure did.

11:52.040 --> 11:56.110
<i>I get it. There are days 
you just want to sit around.</i>

11:56.110 --> 12:00.770
<i>But can't you turn around real quick?</i>

12:00.770 --> 12:04.400
<i>Only for a second would be fine, Mr. Panda...</i>

12:50.620 --> 12:53.580
Three hours later

13:19.020 --> 13:20.120
It's white!

13:19.350 --> 13:20.970
The tail's white!

13:44.000 --> 13:49.960
<i>At a later date, I would write in my report
that it was a long struggle.</i>

13:58.170 --> 14:04.360
<i>Having conquered my serious dilemma, 
I've found my way to the petting zoo.</i>

13:59.730 --> 14:04.360
Petting Zoo

14:04.990 --> 14:08.890
<i>That one has a panda-like pattern.</i>

14:09.610 --> 14:12.470
Would you like to try 
playing with the rabbits?

14:13.890 --> 14:15.820
Adults are welcome too.

14:17.410 --> 14:18.190
Petting Zoo

14:20.390 --> 14:23.700
Just make sure not to stand up
while holding a rabbit.

14:24.600 --> 14:27.160
We also have guinea pigs inside.

14:32.330 --> 14:37.050
<i>I'm supposed to walk without 
stepping on these adorable guys?</i>

14:41.470 --> 14:46.190
<i>What cursed tests these Earthlings concoct!</i>

14:46.740 --> 14:50.320
Oh, wow! They sure seem to like you, mister.

14:51.060 --> 14:54.160
You've got him trapped, 
so come over here, little ones.

14:56.690 --> 14:59.180
Try crouching down to touch them.

15:11.140 --> 15:17.240
It's easiest to pet them on
their backs... To start, I mean.

15:23.240 --> 15:25.280
They like it down

15:25.280 --> 15:28.670
the middle of their backs
with the grain of their fur.

15:29.790 --> 15:32.590
Once the rabbit is used to it,

15:32.590 --> 15:36.450
they like having places like
their head and cheeks rubbed.

15:36.450 --> 15:38.070
<i>This kid...</i>

15:38.070 --> 15:39.360
<i>It's white!</i>

15:38.470 --> 15:40.290
<i>The tail's white!</i>

15:44.340 --> 15:48.050
<i>He's the boy who confirmed 
the panda's tail color with me!</i>

15:48.340 --> 15:51.010
Are you a zoologist?

15:51.870 --> 15:53.430
N-No, I'm not!

15:54.000 --> 15:55.710
I'm still a kid.

15:58.950 --> 16:03.720
But I would like to become an animal doctor.

16:04.470 --> 16:05.740
Oh, yeah?

16:05.740 --> 16:06.490
Yeah.

16:07.230 --> 16:10.130
But Mom said it'll never happen...

16:11.120 --> 16:12.600
Doctor,

16:12.600 --> 16:17.230
could you explain the proper way
to pet them again for me?

16:19.060 --> 16:21.810
"Doctor"? You mean me?

16:21.810 --> 16:22.840
That's right.

16:24.620 --> 16:29.540
I don't have a clue,
 so please teach me, animal doctor.

16:33.130 --> 16:36.620
Petting Zoo

16:33.350 --> 16:34.760
Well, you see...

16:50.010 --> 16:52.080
<i>This warmth.</i>

16:52.300 --> 16:54.170
<i>Its perfect heft.</i>

16:54.170 --> 16:56.660
<i>And above all, the feel...</i>

16:57.500 --> 17:00.010
<i>The sensation of stroking it!</i>

17:00.010 --> 17:03.340
<i>To think something so soothing exists...</i>

17:03.340 --> 17:07.660
<i>Earth is formidable indeed.</i>

17:10.660 --> 17:13.160
We could use this at work.

17:14.010 --> 17:14.980
Could it be...?

17:15.290 --> 17:17.000
I wonder if pandas...

17:15.290 --> 17:18.380
I wonder if pandas are this soft, too.

17:39.030 --> 17:44.090
<i>Once there are more pandas, 
I'll see to it we can touch one another.</i>

17:43.100 --> 17:45.290
Yay! Yay!

17:45.790 --> 17:50.280
<i>When that time comes, 
if he's become an animal doctor...</i>

17:56.980 --> 18:03.740
<i>No, even then, 
humanity will still have to go.</i>

18:15.430 --> 18:20.220
<i>I bet he's thinking up ways 
to wipe out the humans!</i>

18:22.840 --> 18:28.650
<i>What would be a persuasive argument 
for getting some rabbits in here?</i>

18:29.000 --> 18:35.010
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

18:29.000 --> 18:35.010
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

19:08.290 --> 19:10.660
<i>Today's my day off.</i>

19:10.660 --> 19:14.920
<i>I'd love to get myself out of here 
with the grace of a shooting star,</i>

19:15.200 --> 19:18.040
<i>but sadly, I missed my chance...</i>

19:19.440 --> 19:23.800
So we meet again, 
nice guy from the Evil League.

19:24.060 --> 19:27.600
Today's the day you fight Ranger Dawn Red!

19:29.990 --> 19:32.720
Does that mean our truce 
is back in effect today?

19:33.250 --> 19:37.470
There are no pandas here
and no other pedestrians around.

19:37.470 --> 19:38.950
Are you trying to escape?!

19:39.360 --> 19:42.500
I have a mission to defeat you guys!

19:42.500 --> 19:43.760
Just hold on.

19:44.070 --> 19:46.370
I'm serious about the truce today.

19:46.370 --> 19:49.000
I absolutely do not want to work.

19:49.000 --> 19:52.800
But there's a bigger reason 
I can't throw down now.

19:53.260 --> 19:57.790
I've got two cartons of eggs
 in this reusable bag.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.900
Eggs?!

19:58.900 --> 20:01.500
I'm currently on a hot spring egg kick.

20:01.500 --> 20:02.490
Well...

20:02.980 --> 20:05.620
Hot spring eggs <i>are</i> delicious.

20:05.620 --> 20:09.100
It's hard to make them properly.

20:09.100 --> 20:10.780
I'm still practicing.

20:10.780 --> 20:12.290
Good luck with that.

20:12.290 --> 20:13.470
Thank you.

20:14.100 --> 20:17.930
Now then, I can't have
 my eggs getting broken.

20:17.930 --> 20:19.980
Wait here for a spell.

20:36.540 --> 20:38.370
<i>No sign of him.</i>

20:38.370 --> 20:40.170
<i>I wonder if he gave me the slip.</i>

20:40.880 --> 20:44.150
<i>No, he might come back with reinforcements.</i>

20:44.780 --> 20:47.100
<i>He's with the Evil League.</i>

20:47.100 --> 20:49.620
<i>I bet there's no low he wouldn't stoop to.</i>

20:50.580 --> 20:54.910
<i>But as the Red Ranger, 
I have to fight back fair and square.</i>

21:01.960 --> 21:03.320
Use this.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.240
<i>A weapon?</i>

21:05.890 --> 21:08.980
This, too. You don't have to give it back.

21:08.980 --> 21:12.050
Also, someone I know gave me 
more snacks than I can eat.

21:12.050 --> 21:14.050
You take the rest.

21:23.490 --> 21:27.810
As for the station, go straight ahead
and turn left at the third light.

21:27.810 --> 21:30.140
Th-That's very kind. Thank you.

21:30.140 --> 21:32.460
<i>How could he tell I was lost?!</i>

21:32.460 --> 21:33.470
<i>He's amazing!</i>

21:33.920 --> 21:34.950
<i>But still...</i>

21:35.370 --> 21:36.240
Huh?

21:37.140 --> 21:40.110
Y-You're really not going to fight?

21:40.430 --> 21:42.100
Certainly not.

21:45.500 --> 21:48.240
Today's my day off, after all.

23:20.040 --> 23:20.830
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

23:22.300 --> 23:25.890
A night when sighs turn 
into mist and dissolve.

23:26.710 --> 23:31.050
The convenience store 
is a lonely spacecraft.

23:31.960 --> 23:38.110
People impulsively yield themselves to the 
Chinese dumplings in the display case.

23:39.370 --> 23:42.260
A warmth that spreads deep within.

23:42.730 --> 23:44.790
There for an instant, then gone.

23:45.890 --> 23:48.190
The fiends of winter.

23:48.190 --> 23:49.980
The Fiends of Winter
